    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Take Advantage of ZOLLER On-Site Calibrations </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Following accreditation by the German Accreditation Body (DAkkS), ZOLLER has been the only manufacturer of presetting and measuring machines since May 2020 to hold competence in accordance with DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018 to to perform on-site calibrations in the area of dimensional measurements for coordinate measuring technology using ZOLLER presetting and measuring machines.</p> <p>Calibration of presetting and measuring machines in accordance with DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018 is a key factor in ensuring the high quality of end products.</p> <p><strong>Take advantage of ZOLLER’s on-site calibration to enjoy the following benefits:</strong></p><ul><li>Your measuring machine remains on-site and is available at all times</li><li>Measured values are entered under the usual ambient conditions at your site</li><li>Traceable calibration in accordance with DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018, which can only be ensured by an Accredited calibration laboratory</li><li>International recognition of the accredited service and measurement results</li></ul><p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:serviceplanung@zoller-d.com?subject=Termin%20f%C3%BCr%20Vor-Ort-Kalibrierung%20vereinbaren&amp;body=Bitte%20rufen%20Sie%20mich%20an%3A%0AVorname%3A%20%0AName%3A%20%0AFirma%3A%20%0ATel.-Nr.%3A\" title=\"Zur Serviceplanung\"><strong>Schedule an on-site calibration</strong></a></p> <p>You are also welcome to contact Mr. Timo Metsch by phone: +49 7144 8970-392</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/6/csm_genius_versprechen_v2_a210dd8875.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c3272",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The future is coming. There's no safety in doubting that. </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER is committed to delivering premium products and excellent service. Along with innovation and service, quality is a cornerstone of our corporate identity. We underscore our commitment to quality and our associated quality and environmental policies through certifications to ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and VDA 6.4, as well as through an energy audit in accordance with DIN EN 16247-1.</p> <p>How does this benefit you? Verifiably tested and certified electrical and mechanical safety, as well as monitoring of production. And the peace of mind that comes from knowing ZOLLER devices deliver on their promises—not only to millions of satisfied customers but also to external testing institutes.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_pombasic_versprechen_b4a087dd41.webp",
     "alt": "",
